	(text "Input Voltage: 12–18 VDC nominal;\n24 VDC maximum operating input. \nDo not exceed 24 VDC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 54.864 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "373e12da-c4c3-42a2-9057-201dd0097f55")
	)
	(text "The Feedback LED is not part of the AVR HDPI header standard, however, I\nhave included it on the un-used pin so that I can have a status/feedback\nLED for visual feedback from the microcontroller."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 70.358 181.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3edd5042-ba51-43dc-b8c6-ba50d8868ef7")
	)
	(text "### V_in Measurement\n\nThe input voltage is measured through a 51 kΩ / 12 kΩ resistor divider.\n\nThe expected ADC voltage is:\n\n`Vmeasure = V_in × 12 / (51 + 12)`\n\n| Input voltage | Expected Vmeasure |\n|---:|---:|\n| 12 VDC | 2.29 V |\n| 18 VDC | 3.43 V |\n| 24 VDC | 4.57 V |\n\nThese values assume ideal resistor values. Component tolerance and supply variation will introduce small differences."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254.254 43.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
		)
		(uuid "cf38f616-88dc-4830-9fca-8c6717dde6f5")
	)
